## Clinic chat widget (M6). Only public values belong here — no secrets.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_ENABLED=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_SOCKET_PATH=/api/v1/chat/socket.io

